=> SequencedCollection Interface Methods

     -> First Element Access: getFirst()

     -> Last Element Access: getLast()

     -> First Position Insert: addFirst(E e)

     -> Last Position Insert: addLast(E e)

     -> First Element Removal: removeFirst()

     -> Last Element Removal: removeLast()

     -> Reverse Order View: reversed()

     SequencedCollection = Encounter-order based operations

        -> First
        -> Last
        -> Add at beginning
        -> Add at end
        -> Remove from beginning
        -> Remove from end
        -> Reverse view

