=> List Method Availability Rule

     -> List is a child of SequencedCollection.

     -> Therefore List receives all methods of:
          -> SequencedCollection
          -> Collection
          -> Iterable

     -> And List adds its own index-based methods.

     -> Therefore:

          List = Order + Index

          SequencedCollection = Order but not necessarily Index

