=> SequencedSet Interface Methods

     -> SequencedSet (I)
          -> extends Set (I)
          -> extends SequencedCollection (I)

     -> Reverse View Operation
          -> reversed()

     -> Important Point
          -> SequencedSet does not introduce many completely new operations.
          -> Its main purpose is to combine:

               -> Set behavior
                    -> Unique elements

               -> SequencedCollection behavior
                    -> Defined encounter order
                    -> First/Last operations

     -> Therefore:
          SequencedSet = Unique Elements + Defined Encounter Order

