=> NavigableSet Interface Methods

     -> NavigableSet (I)
          -> extends SortedSet (I)

     -> Lower Element Search
          -> lower(E e)

     -> Floor Element Search
          -> floor(E e)

     -> Ceiling Element Search
          -> ceiling(E e)

     -> Higher Element Search
          -> higher(E e)

     -> Poll Boundary Operations
          -> pollFirst()
          -> pollLast()

     -> Descending Order Operations
          -> descendingSet()
          -> descendingIterator()

     -> Advanced Range Operations

          -> subSet(
               E fromElement,
               boolean fromInclusive,
               E toElement,
               boolean toInclusive
             )

          -> headSet(
               E toElement,
               boolean inclusive
             )

          -> tailSet(
               E fromElement,
               boolean inclusive
             )

     -> Important Meaning

          -> lower(e)
               -> Greatest element strictly less than e

          -> floor(e)
               -> Greatest element less than or equal to e

          -> ceiling(e)
               -> Smallest element greater than or equal to e

          -> higher(e)
               -> Smallest element strictly greater than e

