=> Queue Interface Methods

     -> Queue (I)
          -> extends Collection (I)

     -> Insert Operation

          -> add(E e)
               -> Inserts element
               -> Can throw exception if insertion fails

          -> offer(E e)
               -> Inserts element
               -> Returns false if insertion fails


     -> Remove Head Operation

          -> remove()
               -> Removes and returns head
               -> Throws exception if queue is empty

          -> poll()
               -> Removes and returns head
               -> Returns null if queue is empty


     -> Examine Head Operation

          -> element()
               -> Returns head without removing
               -> Throws exception if queue is empty

          -> peek()
               -> Returns head without removing
               -> Returns null if queue is empty


     -> Important Queue Method Pair

          -> Insert
               add()       vs offer()

          -> Remove
               remove()    vs poll()

          -> Examine
               element()   vs peek()

